; MENU / PAUSA - overlay composed into the view canvas (view_buf 20x12) over the CURRENT view and
; copied with the double buffer (3 frames); the HUD window stays visible (the log shows the
; result of GUARDAR / using items). Box cols 4-15, rows 2-10 (canvas rows = screen rows).
; Options at col 7, rows 4-8; BG cursor tile at col 6 on the selected row. Monster, item and
; effect sprites are HIDDEN while any menu is open (they would draw over the box).
tilesets: ui font font_lower
legend:
# AM_WALL
+ AM_UP
, AM_FLOOR
& ICON_HP
^ ICON_STAFF
$ ICON_AMULET
[ ICON_KEY
] ICON_POTION
@ ICON_COMPASS
/ DASH
: COLON
< FRAME_TL
_ FRAME_T
> FRAME_TR
{ FRAME_L
} FRAME_R
( FRAME_BL
= FRAME_B
) FRAME_BR
* CURSOR
